☐ Add soul-search "stats view" modal window popover to the base games "unit card" window, so that users can quickly see the stats of a unit without having to open the full SoulSearch window.
☐ Add widget to the base-game 'creatures' menu to allow users to quickly open a "scoped" SoulSearch window. Scoped means the relevant specific creature type already selected as a filter. (e.g. "Residents" tab will filter to humanoids, and "Pets/Livestock" tab will filter to animals, etc.) (but 'scoped' doesnt specifically mean "scoped to a creature type", it could also be scoped to a specific profession, or a specific location, etc.)
